export default [{"id":"trivia-001","links":[{"id":"5259","kind":"work","text":"AS～エンジェリックセレナーデ"},{"id":"5259","kind":"work","text":"天使小夜曲"}],"number":1,"sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Visual_Novel_Database","https://games.sina.com.cn/newgames/2004/04/041919194.shtml","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/AS～天使小夜曲"],"text":"VNDB的主视觉角色出自《AS～エンジェリックセレナーデ》（《天使小夜曲》），这部游戏曾在2003年由新天地引进国内，有趣的是，它是一部全年龄游戏。","title":"VNDB的主视觉角色"},{"id":"trivia-003","links":[{"id":"84","kind":"work","text":"AIR"}],"number":3,"sources":["https://news.livedoor.com/article/detail/28459470/","https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/digrajprocsummer/2025/0/2025_21/_pdf/-char/en"],"text":"《AIR》的主题歌《鸟之诗》被玩家戏称为“国歌”，还有“国崎往人之歌”的解释；不过，这个称呼最早究竟怎么来的，目前并没有确切结论。","title":"鸟之诗与“国歌”"},{"id":"trivia-004","links":[],"number":4,"sources":["https://akibablog.blog.jp/archives/50737491.html","https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/274569/"],"text":"美少女游戏常常扎堆在月末的星期五发售，这个时间通常赶在工薪阶层发薪之后、周末之前。","title":"月末发售日"},{"id":"trivia-005","links":[{"id":"30","kind":"company","text":"Alice"},{"id":"70","kind":"company","text":"elf"},{"id":"30","kind":"company","text":"AliceSoft"}],"number":5,"sources":["https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Élf","https://michsuzuki.hatenablog.com/entry/2016/08/22/205015","https://retoge-mag.websa.jp/archives/84"],"text":"“东之elf，西之Alice”是当年玩家对两家美少女游戏大厂的并称：elf在东京，AliceSoft在关西，地位和地理位置都对得上。","title":"东之elf，西之Alice"},{"id":"trivia-006","links":[{"id":"316","kind":"company","text":"Leaf"},{"id":"83","kind":"company","text":"Key"}],"number":6,"sources":["https://www.wdic.org/w/WDIC/葉鍵板","https://researchmap.jp/shimokamoto/presentations/18166444/attachment_file.pdf"],"text":"“叶键”是Leaf和Key两家品牌的合称，把英文名字直译过来就是“叶”和“键”。两家的玩家常在一起讨论作品，日本网络上还专门有过“叶键板”。","title":"叶键"},{"id":"trivia-007","links":[{"id":"111","kind":"company","text":"CIRCUS"}],"number":7,"sources":["https://w.atwiki.jp/aniwotawiki/pages/625.html"],"text":"“曲芸商法”是玩家对CIRCUS反复卖同一作品的调侃：同一批角色和素材，追加一些内容、换个平台或重新包装，又能再卖一次。“曲芸”也正好呼应了CIRCUS的“马戏团”之意。","title":"曲芸商法"},{"id":"trivia-008","links":[],"number":8,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202310/15320304.html"],"text":"1991年，京都一名中学生在商店偷拿成人游戏被警方查获，调查随后延伸至游戏厂商，数名负责人被捕。这场“沙织事件”推动了业界建立自主审查机制，次年成立了“ソフ倫”（计算机软件伦理机构）。","title":"沙織事件"},{"id":"trivia-009","links":[{"id":"7551","kind":"work","text":"レイプレイ"}],"number":9,"sources":["https://www.afpbb.com/articles/-/2609003"],"text":"2009年，ILLUSION的《レイプレイ》因描写性暴力而受到海外团体抗议，争议随后波及日本成人游戏业，促使ソフ倫收紧了对相关题材的自主审查。","title":"レイプレイ事件"},{"id":"trivia-010","links":[{"id":"3853","kind":"work","text":"下级生2"}],"number":10,"sources":["https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/下級生2"],"text":"2004年《下级生2》发售后，柴门环已有男友和性经历的设定让部分玩家大为不满，网上甚至出现了要把掰断的光盘寄回厂商的抗议说法。这场风波后来被称为“たまきん事件”。","title":"たまきん事件"},{"id":"trivia-011","links":[{"id":"4529","kind":"work","text":"樱之诗"}],"number":11,"sources":["https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/櫻之詩","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakura_no_Uta","https://www.makura-soft.com/sakuranouta/whatsnew/whatsnew.html","https://yamakamu.net/post-621"],"text":"《樱之诗》原定2004年春发售，玩家一等就是十一年。到了2015年，发售日仍从7月改到9月，再改到10月23日——连等待的最后几个月，也还在延期。","title":"发售延期"},{"id":"trivia-012","links":[],"number":12,"sources":["https://www.bandainamcoent.co.jp/corporate/bnours/nours/vol44/pdf/44_03_09.pdf"],"text":"“マスターアップ”指游戏用于发行的母版已经制作完成，可以进入压盘等环节。","title":"マスターアップ（Master Up）"},{"id":"trivia-013","links":[],"number":13,"sources":["https://cho-animedia.jp/article/2020/08/12/18792.html"],"text":"声优出演成人游戏或成人动画时，常会使用与一般动画不同的名字，俗称“马甲”，日语叫“裏名義”。","title":"马甲（裏名義）"},{"id":"trivia-014","links":[{"id":"1714","kind":"work","text":"家族计划"},{"id":"2487","kind":"work","text":"追憶"},{"id":"2487","kind":"work","text":"絆箱"}],"number":14,"sources":["https://adusa-ciel.my.coocan.jp/kakei/kakei.htm","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/家族计划"],"text":"廉价版是游戏发售一段时间后推出的低价版本，并不意味着质量更低，有时还会增补内容或改善兼容性。例如《家族计划》广为人知的2005年《追憶》，就是去掉附赠特典的廉价版：它保留了2002年《絆箱》加入的语音，而2001年的原版没有配音。","title":"廉价版"},{"id":"trivia-016","links":[{"id":"1795","kind":"company","text":"柚子社"}],"number":16,"sources":["https://kotobank.jp/word/ゆず-12739","https://efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=250084130"],"text":"柚子社的“柚子”其实是香橙，也就是日语里的“ゆず”，和中文里通常说的柚子不是同一种水果。","title":"柚子社的柚子"},{"id":"trivia-017","links":[{"id":"per_fwbeda0cf9202142e9a6d3e641","kind":"person","text":"Lia"},{"id":"83","kind":"company","text":"Key"}],"number":17,"sources":["https://animeanime.jp/article/2018/05/28/37910.html?pickup_list_click1=true"],"text":"Lia临时接下《鸟之诗》的录音后，不光要唱歌，还得在Key工作人员和美国录音师之间兼任日英翻译。","title":"Lia与《鸟之诗》的录音"},{"id":"trivia-018","links":[{"id":"2331","kind":"work","text":"兰斯5D"}],"number":18,"sources":["https://www.alicesoft.com/rance5d/j_02102.html"],"text":"《兰斯5D》之前，曾有过5A、5B、5C三个废案，标题中的D代表第四个开发方案。","title":"《兰斯5D》的D"},{"id":"trivia-019","links":[{"id":"492","kind":"work","text":"とらいあんぐるハート3"},{"id":"1481","kind":"work","text":"リリカルおもちゃ箱"}],"number":19,"sources":["https://www.mandarake.co.jp/information/2007/08/14/12nnb08/index.html"],"text":"高町奈叶原本是成人游戏《とらいあんぐるハート3》里的配角，在后来的Fan Disc《リリカルおもちゃ箱》中当上了魔法少女主角，最后有了自己的独立动画系列。","title":"高町奈叶的出身"},{"id":"trivia-020","links":[{"id":"3254","kind":"work","text":"Fate"},{"id":"per_fw97778e13b53b3dacf8bf7d18","kind":"person","text":"奈须蘑菇"},{"id":"per_fwc768752672573b37ce9d58d4","kind":"person","text":"武内崇"}],"number":20,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/gamenewsplus/190522e"],"text":"奈须蘑菇最早构思《Fate》时，主人公是女性，Saber则是男性；后来制作游戏，武内崇提出把两人的性别对调。","title":"Saber的早期设定"},{"id":"trivia-021","links":[{"id":"per_fw97778e13b53b3dacf8bf7d18","kind":"person","text":"奈须蘑菇"},{"id":"per_fwc768752672573b37ce9d58d4","kind":"person","text":"武内崇"}],"number":21,"sources":["https://tsukikan.com/misc/kanwatsukihime/jp/01"],"text":"奈须蘑菇与武内崇的交情，始于初中时的一次借橡皮；奈须说得太快，武内一开始甚至没听清他要借什么。","title":"奈须蘑菇与武内崇的初识"},{"id":"trivia-022","links":[{"id":"3454","kind":"work","text":"CLANNAD"}],"number":22,"sources":["https://www.cinra.net/index.php/article/interview-201605-fhana"],"text":"音乐组合fhána的几位创始成员，曾因为聊《CLANNAD》聊得投缘而拉近了距离，这也成了后来组团的契机。","title":"fhána与《CLANNAD》"},{"id":"trivia-023","links":[{"id":"1530","kind":"work","text":"你所期望的永远"}],"number":23,"sources":["https://www2.ic.daito.ac.jp/jtogashi/articles/togashi2009a.pdf","https://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/ツンデレ"],"text":"“傲娇”一词，源自玩家对美少女游戏角色的讨论。2002年，有人用“ツンツンデレデレ”形容《你所期望的永远》里的大空寺亚由，后来便缩成了“ツンデレ”。","title":"“傲娇”的由来"},{"id":"trivia-024","links":[],"number":24,"sources":["https://ascii.jp/elem/000/000/319/319417/","https://hit-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2058183/files/070iirWP18-42.pdf","https://www.ntt-east.co.jp/ptd/contents/mag_card.html"],"text":"过去买美少女游戏，店铺常会送印着角色插画的电话卡（公用电话储值卡）。同一款游戏，不同店铺送的卡面还不一样，电话卡也就成了玩家收集的角色周边。","title":"电话卡特典"},{"id":"trivia-025","links":[{"id":"2093","kind":"work","text":"在世界尽头咏唱恋曲的少女YU-NO"}],"number":25,"sources":["https://gametaruru.net/game/pc98-saturn-yuno","https://www.suruga-ya.jp/kaitori/kaitori_detail/145000102","https://www.gamepres.org/catalog/?cat=1&id=8811007169001&nav=brand","https://gyusyabu.ddo.jp/MP3/1996/YUNO1.html"],"text":"1996年的PC-98版《在世界尽头咏唱恋曲的少女YU-NO》，软盘版足足装了15张；同期的CD-ROM版只用1张光盘，甚至还多收录了9首编曲音乐。","title":"CD-ROM与软盘"},{"id":"trivia-026","links":[{"id":"per_fw36d541cb5e909dc81f546c0b","kind":"person","text":"龙骑士07"}],"number":26,"sources":["https://moto-neta.com/stage-name/ryukishi07/","https://sai-zen-sen.jp/works/extras/harukaze07/04/01.html"],"text":"据流传的名字由来，“龙骑士07”取自《最终幻想Ⅴ》里蕾娜的龙骑士造型。“07”是数字谐音：取日语0（rei）和7（nana）的开头，拼出的正是蕾娜（Rena）。","title":"龙骑士07与《最终幻想Ⅴ》"},{"id":"trivia-027","links":[{"id":"1610","kind":"work","text":"月姬"}],"number":27,"sources":["https://www.mandarake.co.jp/information/2006/12/16/21nkn01/index.html"],"text":"1999年冬Comiket上，《月姬》的软盘体验版只卖100日元；到了2006年，Mandarake的同款中古商品已经标价10.5万日元。","title":"《月姬》的软盘体验版"},{"id":"trivia-028","links":[{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉"},{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉鸣泣之时"},{"id":"316","kind":"company","text":"Leaf"},{"id":"1228","kind":"company","text":"07th Expansion"}],"number":28,"sources":["https://sai-zen-sen.jp/works/extras/higurashinonakasekata/01/01.html"],"text":"制作《寒蝉鸣泣之时》前，07th Expansion做的是《Leaf Fight》的同人卡牌。社团后来带着《寒蝉》参加Comiket，仍在卡牌所属的“非电子游戏”分区摆摊。","title":"《寒蝉》与Leaf卡牌"},{"id":"trivia-029","links":[{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉"},{"id":"per_fw36d541cb5e909dc81f546c0b","kind":"person","text":"龙骑士07"}],"number":29,"sources":["https://sai-zen-sen.jp/works/extras/higurashinonakasekata/01/01.html"],"text":"《寒蝉》里那些报纸、档案和旁人证言组成的TIPS，受过《女巫布莱尔》及其外围宣传资料的启发：龙骑士07想用故事之外的零碎材料，让虚构事件显得像真的发生过。","title":"《寒蝉》的TIPS与《女巫布莱尔》"},{"id":"trivia-030","links":[{"id":"30","kind":"company","text":"AliceSoft"}],"number":30,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/projectbook/190801a"],"text":"AliceSoft的诞生，与母公司宣布“不再做成人游戏”有关。后来大家又想做回成人游戏，但话已经放出去了，只好另立AliceSoft这个品牌。","title":"AliceSoft的成立"},{"id":"trivia-031","links":[{"id":"3512","kind":"work","text":"兰斯"},{"id":"per_fweef040970d87ef5896f22d66","kind":"person","text":"TADA"}],"number":31,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/projectbook/190801a"],"text":"早期《兰斯》里，玩家的移动是靠地图格子变色来表示的——TADA当时还不会让角色在地图上走，便用给区域涂色的办法代替。","title":"《兰斯》的涂色地图"},{"id":"trivia-032","links":[{"id":"vndb:p42","kind":"company","text":"Nitroplus"}],"number":32,"sources":["https://www.cyberagent.co.jp/way/list/detail/id=30416"],"text":"Nitroplus名字里的“Nitro”取自硝基化合物，寓意给创作的引擎加上一剂助燃剂。","title":"Nitroplus的名字"},{"id":"trivia-033","links":[{"id":"10917","kind":"work","text":"Rewrite"},{"id":"per_fw36d541cb5e909dc81f546c0b","kind":"person","text":"龙骑士07"},{"id":"per_fw04dcfc642504914c284f4325","kind":"person","text":"田中罗密欧"}],"number":33,"sources":["https://temple-knights.com/archives/2008/04/keyrewrite07.html"],"text":"《Rewrite》是在2008年4月1日公布的，名单里还有田中罗密欧和龙骑士07；当时的日本博客一边报道，一边怀疑这是不是愚人节玩笑。","title":"《Rewrite》的公布日期"},{"id":"trivia-034","links":[{"id":"908","kind":"work","text":"教我说再见"},{"id":"187","kind":"work","text":"Kanon"},{"id":"per_fw12bff949520b1c9909d8008d","kind":"person","text":"长冈建藏"}],"number":34,"sources":["https://realsound.jp/book/2022/12/post-1219292.html","https://realsound.jp/book/2022/12/post-1219292.html/amp"],"text":"《教我说再见》常被传是接到“做一部像《Kanon》的作品”的要求后诞生的。长冈建藏却说，那是老板在新年会上对所有品牌讲的话，他后来觉得意思大概是“做一部像《Kanon》那么能卖的游戏”。","title":"《教我说再见》与《Kanon》的传闻"},{"id":"trivia-035","links":[{"id":"per_fw33dc61ab368448f16a7f75e3","kind":"person","text":"麻枝准"}],"number":35,"sources":["https://angleriver.blog99.fc2.com/blog-entry-289.html"],"text":"麻枝准原本想做游戏作曲，求职接连碰壁后改投剧本岗位，结果投了两家公司，两边的作品审查都通过了。","title":"麻枝准的求职经历"},{"id":"trivia-036","links":[{"id":"per_fw33dc61ab368448f16a7f75e3","kind":"person","text":"麻枝准"},{"id":"83","kind":"company","text":"Key"}],"number":36,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/000/248/248845/"],"text":"Aniplex的鸟羽来找麻枝准谈《Angel Beats!》合作时，花了约四小时讲自己有多喜欢Key，正式的企划提案却是之后才带来的。","title":"《Angel Beats!》的合作洽谈"},{"id":"trivia-037","links":[{"id":"2590","kind":"work","text":"Muv-Luv"},{"id":"4286","kind":"work","text":"Muv-Luv Alternative"}],"number":37,"sources":["https://blog.livedoor.jp/isayamahazime/archives/7653890.html"],"text":"谏山创曾在自己的博客里写道，如果没有《Muv-Luv Alternative》，就不会有《进击的巨人》。","title":"《进击的巨人》与《Muv-Luv》"},{"id":"trivia-038","links":[{"id":"per_fw5aa777be5dc7c8e90a1f9b95","kind":"person","text":"西又葵"}],"number":38,"sources":["https://www.j-cast.com/2008/09/29027661.html?p=all"],"text":"2008年，西又葵为秋田县羽后町的大米绘制了美少女包装，订单多到当地农协一度暂停接单。","title":"西又葵的大米包装"},{"id":"trivia-039","links":[{"id":"2112","kind":"work","text":"D.C."},{"id":"1795","kind":"work","text":"アルキメデスのわすれもの"}],"number":39,"sources":["https://bushiroad.com/media/39ac778b4464395a"],"text":"《D.C.》最早以圣诞短篇的形式，收录在2001年的《アルキメデスのわすれもの》中。这个先行版获得好评，正篇则在次年独立发售。","title":"《D.C.》的先行短篇"},{"id":"trivia-040","links":[{"id":"633","kind":"work","text":"Phantom"},{"id":"per_fwbe4bc9c1aeb65759e4113afe","kind":"person","text":"虚渊玄"}],"number":40,"sources":["https://gigazine.net/news/20141015-nitroplus-machiasobi-13/"],"text":"虚渊玄第一次接到美少女游戏企划的工作，交上去的是清纯恋爱故事；社长觉得不对味，拉他去家庭餐厅重新商量，后来做出来的便是《Phantom》。","title":"虚渊玄的清纯恋爱企划"},{"id":"trivia-041","links":[{"id":"5804","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart2"},{"id":"6093","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart2 XRATED"}],"number":41,"sources":["https://aquaplus.jp/th2/","https://www7a.biglobe.ne.jp/tuckf/GameReview/toheart2x.html","https://blog.livedoor.jp/seochan_k/archives/50255877.html"],"text":"《ToHeart2》先在2004年推出PS2版，次年才以《ToHeart2 XRATED》的名字推出PC成人版；这种从主机移植到PC的方向，当时被称为“逆移植”。","title":"《ToHeart2》的逆移植"},{"id":"trivia-042","links":[{"id":"475","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart"},{"id":"644","kind":"company","text":"AQUAPLUS"}],"number":42,"sources":["https://game.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/20011203/piece.htm","https://aquaplus.jp/piece/soft.html","https://aquaplus.jp/piece/"],"text":"制作《ToHeart》的AQUAPLUS，也在2001年卖过自己的掌机P/ECE，还附上开发工具让玩家自己写游戏。它的配套游戏里，就有Multi当主角的《おでかけマルチ》。","title":"AQUAPLUS的掌机P/ECE"},{"id":"trivia-043","links":[{"id":"per_fw0f3553461050dd2936d4e43a","kind":"person","text":"八木沼悟志"}],"number":43,"sources":["https://nbcuni-music.com/fripside/news/index00090000.html"],"text":"fripSide原本想叫“flipside”，也就是唱片的B面。八木沼悟志发现乐队、商店、票务公司都用过这个名字，觉得搜索起来太麻烦，便把拼写改成了fripSide。","title":"fripSide的名字"},{"id":"trivia-044","links":[{"id":"2016","kind":"work","text":"传颂之物"},{"id":"per_fw779e7efc1eca9643f036aac4","kind":"person","text":"Suara"}],"number":44,"sources":["https://fixrecords.com/suara/profile","https://ototoy.jp/feature/20151014"],"text":"演唱《传颂之物》多首歌曲的Suara，名字在印度尼西亚语里就是“声音”，她大学时学的也正是印尼语。","title":"Suara的名字"},{"id":"trivia-045","links":[{"id":"2392","kind":"work","text":"Only You"},{"id":"2392","kind":"work","text":"Only You ～世紀末のジュリエット達～"}],"number":45,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2021/11/1994-1995.html"],"text":"《Only You ～世紀末のジュリエット達～》用了太多其他作品的梗，制作方担心惹上麻烦，便改成用户俱乐部限定销售——当时其实还没有人投诉或起诉。","title":"《Only You》的限定销售"},{"id":"trivia-046","links":[{"id":"per_fwbe4bc9c1aeb65759e4113afe","kind":"person","text":"虚渊玄"},{"id":"vndb:p42","kind":"company","text":"Nitroplus"}],"number":46,"sources":["https://gigazine.net/news/20141015-nitroplus-machiasobi-13/"],"text":"虚渊玄在动画里的署名，后面经常跟着“（Nitroplus）”，是为了让动画观众记住公司名字，再来玩他们的美少女游戏。","title":"虚渊玄的动画署名"},{"id":"trivia-047","links":[{"id":"9960","kind":"work","text":"CHAOS;HEAD"}],"number":47,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/000/139/139957/"],"text":"《CHAOS;HEAD》开发时用过“哀SWORD”“C.O.D.E.”和“ギガロマニアックス”等企划名，后两个虽然没当上标题，却留在游戏里成了术语。","title":"《CHAOS;HEAD》的企划名"},{"id":"trivia-048","links":[{"id":"12797","kind":"work","text":"命运石之门"},{"id":"15958","kind":"work","text":"命运石之门 变移空间的八重奏"}],"number":48,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/108/G010892/20111105003/"],"text":"《命运石之门 变移空间的八重奏》连老电脑“忙不过来”的感觉都要还原：显示文字时，BGM会故意晚一点响起。","title":"《命运石之门》的复古演出"},{"id":"trivia-049","links":[{"id":"1530","kind":"work","text":"你所期望的永远"},{"id":"per_fw9697371f2d51e08d20c172be","kind":"person","text":"栗林美奈实"}],"number":49,"sources":["https://lp.p.pia.jp/article/news/24782/index.html"],"text":"栗林美奈实接下《你所期望的永远》时，原本只负责配音和主题歌作词。交了一份试唱后，制作人问她要不要连歌也一起唱，于是有了她演唱的《Rumbling hearts》。","title":"栗林美奈实与《Rumbling hearts》"},{"id":"trivia-050","links":[{"id":"13176","kind":"work","text":"心跳回忆"},{"id":"475","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart"}],"number":50,"sources":["https://note.com/tiyu/n/n77f5a70a747f"],"text":"1997年《心跳回忆》曾发售过印有角色立绘的床单，玩家石原哲把床单套在抱枕上，后来还为此专门定制了170厘米的枕芯，并将床单改成带拉链的枕套。这种做法在部分玩家间传开，让同人作者チャンコ増田想到直接制作现成的角色睡姿抱枕套，于是在同年10月的同人活动上推出了《ToHeart》的抱枕套，这也被认为是最早公开贩售的等身大角色抱枕套。","title":"等身角色抱枕套"},{"id":"trivia-051","links":[{"id":"603","kind":"work","text":"Piaキャロットへようこそ!!"}],"number":51,"sources":["https://sotokanda.net/his_cafe.html"],"text":"秋叶原女仆咖啡厅的一条重要源流，来自美少女游戏《Piaキャロットへようこそ!!》：1998年，Broccoli在展会上还原了游戏里的餐厅，让工作人员穿着游戏制服提供餐饮服务。这个企划次年开到了秋叶原，从限时餐厅发展为常设店，后来经改装，成为2001年开业的Cure Maid Café。","title":"女仆咖啡厅与美少女游戏"},{"id":"trivia-052","links":[{"id":"3454","kind":"work","text":"CLANNAD"},{"id":"per_fw33dc61ab368448f16a7f75e3","kind":"person","text":"麻枝准"}],"number":52,"sources":["https://jmagazine.myjcom.jp/category/anime/post000189/"],"text":"《CLANNAD》动画里的《团子大家族》，旋律来自游戏BGM《渚》。麻枝准后来却笑着抱怨：《渚》一响，大家都管它叫《团子大家族》。","title":"《渚》与《团子大家族》"},{"id":"trivia-053","links":[{"id":"26999","kind":"work","text":"壳之少女"}],"number":53,"sources":["https://www.ima-ero.com/lecture/secret_trick-small_material/"],"text":"《壳之少女》全语音HD版的桌面图标，调成小图标是一颗黑色的蛋，换成中等大小，就变成了破壳而出的少女。","title":"《壳之少女》的桌面图标"},{"id":"trivia-054","links":[{"id":"323","kind":"work","text":"雫"},{"id":"per_fwe095b890b47076e5ce931bff","kind":"person","text":"高桥龙也"},{"id":"316","kind":"company","text":"Leaf"}],"number":54,"sources":["https://www.tinami.com/x/interview/04/page1.html"],"text":"《雫》的“电波”风格，受过筋肉少女带主唱大槻贤二所写小说的影响。高桥龙也觉得，当时规模还很小的Leaf想被人记住，就得做些别家没有的东西，于是把自己的文学趣味带进了游戏。","title":"《雫》与大槻贤二"},{"id":"trivia-055","links":[{"id":"323","kind":"work","text":"雫"},{"id":"per_fwe095b890b47076e5ce931bff","kind":"person","text":"高桥龙也"}],"number":55,"sources":["https://www.tinami.com/x/interview/04/page2.html"],"text":"高桥龙也和十来个朋友轮流借着玩《弟切草》，聚在一起聊剧情，才发现各自玩到的竟不是同一个故事——他们此前还不知道，游戏会随选择分支。他后来制作《雫》，也想让玩家体会这种惊喜。","title":"高桥龙也与《弟切草》"},{"id":"trivia-056","links":[{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉"},{"id":"per_fw36d541cb5e909dc81f546c0b","kind":"person","text":"龙骑士07"}],"number":56,"sources":["https://www.cs.furyu.jp/kataruhito/hgn/"],"text":"《寒蝉》最初卖不动，龙骑士07便把《鬼隐篇》的光盘塞进自家同人卡牌的邮购包裹里。收到询问时，他就说是“寄错了，不过送给你，请玩玩看”。","title":"“寄错”的《寒蝉》"},{"id":"trivia-057","links":[{"id":"7535","kind":"work","text":"ぶらばん！"},{"id":"1795","kind":"company","text":"柚子社"}],"number":57,"sources":["https://rocketnews24.com/2019/04/04/1193746/"],"text":"柚子社2006年出道作《ぶらばん！》的主题曲叫《Beautiful Harmony》；十三年后，日本外务省恰好用同样的词解释新年号“令和”，这首游戏歌曲也在改元时被重新翻了出来。","title":"《Beautiful Harmony》与“令和”"},{"id":"trivia-058","links":[{"id":"per_fwda970b89e3a33b1696005898","kind":"person","text":"KOTOKO"},{"id":"per_fw05950c5fec30be6fa3fa4279","kind":"person","text":"I’ve"}],"number":58,"sources":["https://originalnews.nico/110719"],"text":"KOTOKO参加I’ve试唱后，花了约一小时回到家，录用的留言却已经先她一步到了。决定快得出奇，录音室又是普通住宅改的，她当时反而觉得有点可疑。","title":"KOTOKO的试唱"},{"id":"trivia-059","links":[{"id":"323","kind":"work","text":"雫"},{"id":"198","kind":"work","text":"痕"},{"id":"per_fwe095b890b47076e5ce931bff","kind":"person","text":"高桥龙也"}],"number":59,"sources":["https://www.tinami.com/x/interview/04/page3.html"],"text":"《雫》和《痕》的单色背景，也与当年PC-98版的16色显示限制有关；高桥龙也却觉得，这正好契合了《雫》“褪色的世界”，换成鲜艳的全彩反而不像它了。","title":"《雫》的16色背景"},{"id":"trivia-060","links":[],"number":60,"sources":["https://global.brother/ja/digest/history/takeru"],"text":"1986年问世的TAKERU软件自动售货机，能在玩家付钱后现场写好游戏软盘、打印说明书。后来，这套远程传送数据的技术又被拿来配送歌曲，发展出了通信卡拉OK服务JOYSOUND。","title":"软件自动售货机TAKERU"},{"id":"trivia-061","links":[{"id":"2704","kind":"work","text":"斩魔大圣Demonbane"},{"id":"per_fwbe4bc9c1aeb65759e4113afe","kind":"person","text":"虚渊玄"},{"id":"per_fwa5a6bf4eb0c9d471a81fcf04","kind":"person","text":"钢屋Jin"},{"id":"316","kind":"company","text":"Leaf"},{"id":"vndb:p42","kind":"company","text":"Nitroplus"}],"number":61,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/138/G013849/20120801088/index_2.html","https://www.4gamer.net/games/138/G013849/20120801088/"],"text":"《斩魔大圣Demonbane》的编剧钢屋Jin，最早是在Leaf官网的短篇小说论坛上写同人。后来，虚渊玄读到了他在网上写的同人小说，便邀他加入Nitroplus。","title":"钢屋Jin的同人时期"},{"id":"trivia-062","links":[{"id":"10935","kind":"work","text":"魔法使之夜"}],"number":62,"sources":["https://www.typemoon.com/download/pdf/mahoyo_panf.pdf","https://blog.livedoor.jp/sekota_syu/archives/51867191.html"],"text":"2012年《魔法使之夜》的官方通販特典，是一本架空电影宣传手册，青子、有珠等角色还以“演员”身份接受了采访。青子在里面抱怨：剧组不用CG，竟然让她花两年练会了发射光束。","title":"《魔法使之夜》的“演员访谈”"},{"id":"trivia-063","links":[{"id":"13816","kind":"work","text":"爱相随＋"}],"number":63,"sources":["https://news.livedoor.com/article/detail/4879021/","https://pascaled.blog22.fc2.com/blog-entry-472.html"],"text":"2010年《爱相随＋》与热海联动时，独自入住大野屋旅馆非单人房的玩家，只要说明自己带了《爱相随＋》，就能免费多铺一床被褥，留给游戏里的“女朋友”。","title":"《爱相随＋》的热海住宿联动"},{"id":"trivia-064","links":[{"id":"9716","kind":"work","text":"Kira☆Kira"},{"id":"1857","kind":"company","text":"OVERDRIVE"}],"number":64,"sources":["https://www.sonicsystem.co.jp/sonix/archives/79247","https://www.ishibashi.co.jp/sale-event/16001"],"text":"OVERDRIVE曾与ESP合作，把《Kira☆Kira》里椎野きらり使用的吉他做成了周边，而且是真能拿来演奏的电吉他。","title":"《Kira☆Kira》的吉他周边"},{"id":"trivia-065","links":[{"id":"323","kind":"work","text":"雫"},{"id":"198","kind":"work","text":"痕"},{"id":"475","kind":"work","text":"To Heart"},{"id":"316","kind":"company","text":"Leaf"}],"number":65,"sources":["https://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/ビジュアルノベル","https://nais.or.jp/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Vol11_039-044.pdf"],"text":"“视觉小说（Visual Novel）”原本是Leaf给《雫》《痕》《To Heart》等作品使用的系列名，后来却成了整个游戏类型的通称。","title":"视觉小说（Visual Novel）"},{"id":"trivia-066","links":[{"id":"3713","kind":"work","text":"同级生"},{"id":"per_fwd5b15eb58f03ca4f5d7c4e07","kind":"person","text":"蛭田昌人"},{"id":"per_fw8fcc8ab7456c65fb25c98d10","kind":"person","text":"竹井正树"}],"number":66,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202310/08318863.html"],"text":"《同级生》最初打算做成一款搭讪游戏，让玩家在40天里搭讪50多名女性。蛭田昌人看过竹井正树的人设后，觉得这些角色只用来搭讪太可惜，便把人数缩减到14人，为每个人编写恋爱故事。","title":"《同级生》的搭讪企划"},{"id":"trivia-067","links":[{"id":"1584","kind":"work","text":"いちご打"},{"id":"per_fwc9f0c2ee823d72ec2c223046","kind":"person","text":"桃井晴子"}],"number":67,"sources":["https://animeanime.jp/article/2020/03/13/52167_2.html","https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/59747?device=smartphone&page=2"],"text":"桃井晴子写《いちご打》的主题曲《いちごGO!GO!》时，想让它不被秋叶原街头的喧闹和电器店广告歌盖过去，便用了容易记住的旋律和抢耳的歌词。","title":"《いちごGO!GO!》与秋叶原"},{"id":"trivia-068","links":[{"id":"13176","kind":"work","text":"心跳回忆"},{"id":"5493","kind":"work","text":"心跳回忆3"},{"id":"5444","kind":"work","text":"Girl’s Side"}],"number":68,"sources":["https://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/0301/17/njbt_04.html"],"text":"《心跳回忆》曾通过专门的游戏基金向公众募集开发资金，用于制作《心跳回忆3》和《Girl’s Side》，再按游戏出货量决定回款。最后每份面额1万日元的基金，兑付了10088日元。","title":"《心跳回忆》基金"},{"id":"trivia-069","links":[{"id":"3713","kind":"work","text":"同级生"}],"number":69,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202310/08318863.html"],"text":"1992年的《同级生》启动时，会先问玩家用的是彩色还是黑白显示器：当时仍有PC-98笔记本使用黑白液晶屏，得换一套配色，彩色CG在上面才看得清楚。","title":"《同级生》的黑白显示模式"},{"id":"trivia-070","links":[{"id":"4862","kind":"work","text":"悠久之翼"}],"number":70,"sources":["https://www.minori.ph/lineup/ef/emotionalflutter.html","https://w.atwiki.jp/gamemusicbest100/pages/4078.html","https://www.oricon.co.jp/prof/395769/products/764967/1/"],"text":"《悠久之翼》（ef）的音乐命名也藏着“ef”：主题歌单曲CD《eternal feather》，以及歌曲《emotional flutter》《ever forever》，两个单词的首字母拼起来都是“ef”。","title":"《悠久之翼》的音乐命名"},{"id":"trivia-071","links":[{"id":"187","kind":"work","text":"Kanon"},{"id":"83","kind":"company","text":"Key"}],"number":71,"sources":["https://key.visualarts.gr.jp/product/kanon/qa/"],"text":"《Kanon》片尾曲《風の辿り着く場所》完整版里有一段英文人声，玩家曾向Key询问歌词。官方的回答却是：那段来自采样CD，他们手里也没有歌词资料。","title":"《Kanon》的英文采样"},{"id":"trivia-072","links":[{"id":"13176","kind":"work","text":"心跳回忆"}],"number":72,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/201410/30064441.html"],"text":"《实况力量棒球》的“Success”球员育成模式，受过开发组当时沉迷的《心跳回忆》启发：三年可以用来谈恋爱，也可以用来培养棒球选手，连随季节更换BGM的做法也一起借了过来。","title":"《心跳回忆》与棒球育成"},{"id":"trivia-073","links":[],"number":73,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202311/12323632.html"],"text":"“美少女游戏”是《テクノポリス》杂志在1980年代推广起来的称呼，当时也包括以美少女角色为卖点的一般向作品。杂志背后的德间书店，甚至曾把“美少女ゲーム”和“美少女ソフト”注册成商标。","title":"“美少女游戏”的称呼"},{"id":"trivia-074","links":[{"id":"14312","kind":"work","text":"认真和我谈恋爱！S"},{"id":"16278","kind":"work","text":"雪色"}],"number":74,"sources":["https://c-agent.net/kenketsu/c081/index.html","https://www.famitsu.com/news/201112/27007817.html"],"text":"2011年冬季Comiket 81的献血应援活动，把美少女游戏海报做成了限量赠品：符合条件、完成400毫升献血的参与者，可领取五家厂商提供的一套海报，其中包括《认真和我谈恋爱！S》和《雪色》。","title":"Comiket的献血海报"},{"id":"trivia-075","links":[{"id":"15929","kind":"work","text":"君与彼女与彼女之恋。"}],"number":75,"sources":["https://www.nitroplus.co.jp/game/totono/interview/01.php","https://www.nitroplus.co.jp/game/22-totono/"],"text":"《君与彼女与彼女之恋。》初回限定版用U盘装游戏，是因为制作人想做出拆iPhone包装盒的感觉。盒子做小了，DVD放不进去，只好换成成本约为DVD十倍的U盘。","title":"《君与彼女与彼女之恋。》的U盘版"},{"id":"trivia-076","links":[{"id":"3006","kind":"work","text":"月は東に日は西に"}],"number":76,"sources":["https://august-soft.com/20th/history/"],"text":"《月は東に日は西に》的简称“はにはに”，取的全是标题里的平假名。制作组当时在白板上调整汉字和平假名的大小、错开位置，就这样发现了这个简称。","title":"“はにはに”的简称"},{"id":"trivia-077","links":[{"id":"2345","kind":"work","text":"BALDR FORCE"}],"number":77,"sources":["https://www.sofmap.com/tenpo/event/5000049.htm"],"text":"2002年《BALDR FORCE》的试玩活动，奖品电话卡上的“恭喜获得A级”都印好了，制作方才发现难度太高，把领奖门槛降到了B级；到了活动现场，又降成了C级。","title":"《BALDR FORCE》的试玩奖品"},{"id":"trivia-078","links":[{"id":"19981","kind":"work","text":"FLOWERS"},{"id":"1377","kind":"company","text":"Innocent Grey"}],"number":78,"sources":["https://www.gamer.ne.jp/news/201904200001/"],"text":"做惯了R18游戏的Innocent Grey，推出全年龄百合游戏《FLOWERS》后，还是遇到了作品被店家摆进R18专区的情况。","title":"《FLOWERS》的店铺分区"},{"id":"trivia-079","links":[{"id":"13870","kind":"work","text":"With Ribbon"},{"id":"per_fw8ead2bcd81ff8cc49a50b464","kind":"person","text":"遥空"}],"number":79,"sources":["https://blog.getchu.com/archives/52175487.html"],"text":"刚开始给美少女游戏配音的遥空，录完《With Ribbon》的台本便兴奋地说，要等游戏发售看看结局。导演和音响监督却一脸茫然：她刚录完的，其实只是体验版。","title":"遥空与《With Ribbon》"},{"id":"trivia-080","links":[{"id":"per_fw944e343612b62895af4988a8","kind":"person","text":"志仓千代丸"},{"id":"2282","kind":"company","text":"5pb."}],"number":80,"sources":["https://jin115.com/archives/51671729.html"],"text":"5pb.名字里的“5”，指的是视觉、听觉、触觉、味觉和嗅觉；志仓千代丸取这个名字，是想通过“五感”让人受到感动。","title":"5pb.的名字"},{"id":"trivia-081","links":[{"id":"275","kind":"company","text":"Frontwing"}],"number":81,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202004/11193500.html"],"text":"以《灰色》系列闻名的Frontwing，最初做的是卡牌游戏进出口，制作游戏原本只是兴趣。","title":"Frontwing的早期业务"},{"id":"trivia-082","links":[{"id":"731","kind":"work","text":"Mamatoto"}],"number":82,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2023/11/blog-post_16.html"],"text":"《Mamatoto》用上了两部未完成游戏留下的素材：废案《兰斯5》的角色，以及卡牌游戏《Vis-A-Vis》的大量图像。","title":"《Mamatoto》的素材来源"},{"id":"trivia-083","links":[{"id":"21996","kind":"work","text":"爱上火车"}],"number":83,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202402/22331712.html"],"text":"《爱上火车》的主题曲《レイル・ロマネスク》采用6/8拍，呼应了女主角“八六”的名字。","title":"《レイル・ロマネスク》的拍号"},{"id":"trivia-084","links":[{"id":"21996","kind":"work","text":"爱上火车"},{"id":"per_fw70b9991d2ed7623658f4d9fb","kind":"person","text":"进行豹"}],"number":84,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202402/22331712.html"],"text":"进行豹最初想把自己喜欢的国铁KiHa07型柴油动车写成《爱上火车》的主角，制作方却更中意蒸汽机车。他便从仍有蒸汽机车运行的地方寻找舞台，最后选中了熊本人吉。","title":"《爱上火车》的车型选择"},{"id":"trivia-085","links":[{"id":"21996","kind":"work","text":"爱上火车"},{"id":"per_fw70b9991d2ed7623658f4d9fb","kind":"person","text":"进行豹"}],"number":85,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202402/22331712.html"],"text":"《爱上火车》原本更侧重人物故事，进行豹取材时亲自给蒸汽机车铲煤，却连狭窄的炉口都不容易对准。体会到操作的辛苦后，他决定把机车驾驶和铁路运转也详细写进游戏。","title":"《爱上火车》的铁路取材"},{"id":"trivia-086","links":[{"id":"13176","kind":"work","text":"心跳回忆"},{"id":"12743","kind":"work","text":"爱相随"},{"id":"per_fw11f6cd0c2109faceb92867bc","kind":"person","text":"内田明理"}],"number":86,"sources":["https://www.nintendo.co.jp/3ds/interview/creators/vol6/index.html","https://www.nintendo.co.jp/3ds/interview/creators/vol6/index2.html"],"text":"《爱相随》制作人内田明理，曾训斥为了买《心跳回忆》而迟到的同事。后来自己为了工作研究这部游戏，却玩了个通宵，收到藤崎诗织的手制巧克力时还高兴得不得了。","title":"内田明理与《心跳回忆》"},{"id":"trivia-087","links":[{"id":"19232","kind":"work","text":"苍之彼方的四重奏"}],"number":87,"sources":["https://gigazine.net/news/20150827-aokana/"],"text":"《苍之彼方的四重奏》的美术人员，曾用Google Earth沿日本各地岛屿的海岸线寻找舞台。最后选中的地方既有适合飞行鞋发挥的地形起伏，从空中望去，又处处能把岛和海收入画面。","title":"《苍之彼方的四重奏》的舞台取材"},{"id":"trivia-088","links":[{"id":"19232","kind":"work","text":"苍之彼方的四重奏"}],"number":88,"sources":["https://gigazine.net/news/20150827-aokana/"],"text":"《苍之彼方的四重奏》筹备动画时，工作人员用手办和演示板推演飞行比赛，才发现一个问题：这两个人明明隔了三十米，怎么还在正常聊天？","title":"《苍之彼方的四重奏》的动画推演"},{"id":"trivia-089","links":[{"id":"26724","kind":"work","text":"拔作岛"},{"id":"5728","kind":"company","text":"Qruppo"}],"number":89,"sources":["https://febri.jp/topics/nukitashi1/"],"text":"くまた喜欢《拔作岛》的配角スス子，却苦于她当时没有个人路线，便不断画她的同人图，也因此结识了Qruppo。后来动画启动，他在人设竞稿中获选，成为动画版的角色设计师。","title":"《拔作岛》动画的人设担当"},{"id":"trivia-090","links":[{"id":"12797","kind":"work","text":"命运石之门"}],"number":90,"sources":["https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20110602-steinsgate/2"],"text":"《命运石之门》的牧濑红莉栖，最初只是给冈部补充知识的配角；可两人在故事里相处得太久，写着写着有了羁绊，剧本完成时她已经成了女主角。","title":"牧濑红莉栖的早期设定"},{"id":"trivia-091","links":[{"id":"12797","kind":"work","text":"命运石之门"},{"id":"per_fw944e343612b62895af4988a8","kind":"person","text":"志仓千代丸"},{"id":"per_fwf95c2fb66c4245a921a6c4c0","kind":"person","text":"林直孝"}],"number":91,"sources":["https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20110602-steinsgate/2"],"text":"志仓千代丸把《命运石之门》里的雷Net做出了棋盘、棋子和规则，还经常拿来对战。林直孝赢过他一次后，两人就没再比过，于是“最强玩家”的名号便留给了林直孝。","title":"雷Net的开发者对局"},{"id":"trivia-092","links":[{"id":"per_fwfaf809435ae016245a1ac87f","kind":"person","text":"bamboo"}],"number":92,"sources":["https://sleepfreaks-dtm.com/music-industry/bamboo/"],"text":"bamboo进入美少女游戏行业时打过一个算盘：用游戏公司的预算做音乐，自己的乐队milktub就不用自掏腰包了。","title":"bamboo与milktub"},{"id":"trivia-093","links":[{"id":"8939","kind":"work","text":"FORTUNE ARTERIAL"},{"id":"per_fw99314e770ba100eaf3a04ee7","kind":"person","text":"夏野イオ"},{"id":"per_fwed95ca9d74f3c9d8ce571447","kind":"person","text":"べっかんこう"},{"id":"609","kind":"company","text":"August"}],"number":93,"sources":["https://august-soft.com/20th/history/"],"text":"夏野イオ找工作前看过《FORTUNE ARTERIAL》动画，还会在卡拉OK唱它的OP；这部动画也成了应聘August的契机之一，后来便与べっかんこう一起为公司画原画。","title":"夏野イオ与August"},{"id":"trivia-094","links":[{"id":"32184","kind":"work","text":"主播女孩重度依赖"},{"id":"per_fwb5d78d29ce90b8b5103ec9dd","kind":"person","text":"にゃるら"}],"number":94,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/537/G053796/20230626001/"],"text":"为了揣摩《主播女孩重度依赖》里漂亮女孩的心思，にゃるら开始护肤、脱毛、研究穿搭，把自己也打扮得时髦起来。","title":"にゃるら的穿搭"},{"id":"trivia-095","links":[{"id":"26478","kind":"work","text":"心跳文学部"},{"id":"1610","kind":"work","text":"月姬"},{"id":"per_fw966f9ac6acfb5ba52cb59f7a","kind":"person","text":"Dan Salvato"}],"number":95,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/180201b"],"text":"《心跳文学部》的作者Dan Salvato其实不常玩Galgame，一个原因是很多作品没有英文版；2018年被问到最喜欢的视觉小说时，他给出的答案却是《月姬》。","title":"Dan Salvato与视觉小说"},{"id":"trivia-097","links":[{"id":"per_fwbeda0cf9202142e9a6d3e641","kind":"person","text":"Lia"},{"id":"307","kind":"company","text":"Liar-soft"}],"number":97,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202004/11193500.html"],"text":"Liar-soft的创办成员原先在日本游戏公司遊演体工作，做的是一种靠寄信玩的游戏：玩家把自己扮演的角色接下来想做什么写信寄来，编剧根据这些来信续写剧情，再把故事寄回去。后来，这群编剧自己成立了美少女游戏公司。","title":"Liar-soft的创办成员"},{"id":"trivia-098","links":[{"id":"38631","kind":"work","text":"魔法少女的魔女审判"}],"number":98,"sources":["https://www.inside-games.jp/article/2026/01/19/176258.html"],"text":"《魔法少女的魔女审判》的处刑按钮，直到发售当天早上才实装，音效也是当天赶出来的；到了当天下午，制作人员还在做片尾职员表。","title":"《魔法少女的魔女审判》的发售日"},{"id":"trivia-099","links":[{"id":"3687","kind":"company","text":"Visual Arts"}],"number":99,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/191105a/2"],"text":"Visual Arts曾刻意淡化母公司名字，让玩家先记住旗下各个品牌。后来却有新品牌主动要求挂上Visual Arts的标志，觉得这样显得更有实力。","title":"Visual Arts与旗下品牌"},{"id":"trivia-100","links":[{"id":"per_fwd404c1df73fc2db0137547f9","kind":"person","text":"马场隆博"},{"id":"per_fw05950c5fec30be6fa3fa4279","kind":"person","text":"I’ve"},{"id":"3687","kind":"company","text":"Visual Arts"}],"number":100,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/191105a/2"],"text":"I’ve早年给多家游戏公司写歌，自己的名字却不太为人所知。Visual Arts的马场隆博推动他们在游戏包装上挂标志、保留歌曲版权，后来再把积累的歌曲做成自己的CD。","title":"I’ve的署名与唱片"},{"id":"trivia-101","links":[{"id":"5381","kind":"work","text":"ONE"},{"id":"5381","kind":"work","text":"ONE～辉之季节～"},{"id":"1610","kind":"work","text":"月姬"},{"id":"per_fw97778e13b53b3dacf8bf7d18","kind":"person","text":"奈须蘑菇"},{"id":"per_fwc768752672573b37ce9d58d4","kind":"person","text":"武内崇"}],"number":101,"sources":["https://jpbma.or.jp/column/column-319/"],"text":"武内崇曾推荐奈须蘑菇玩PS版《ONE～辉之季节～》，让奈须发现，视觉小说可以如此着重主人公的内心和故事。这也成了两人尝试制作《月姬》的契机。","title":"《月姬》与《ONE》"},{"id":"trivia-102","links":[{"id":"per_fweef040970d87ef5896f22d66","kind":"person","text":"TADA"},{"id":"30","kind":"company","text":"AliceSoft"}],"number":102,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2021/03/blog-post.html"],"text":"TADA早年用BASIC做游戏，程序和台词都混着写。同学MRG拿来一套业余写的文字冒险制作工具让他试用，这便成了后来AliceSoft游戏引擎的起点。","title":"AliceSoft的游戏引擎"},{"id":"trivia-103","links":[{"id":"8282","kind":"work","text":"Little Vampire"},{"id":"per_fweef040970d87ef5896f22d66","kind":"person","text":"TADA"}],"number":103,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2021/03/blog-post.html"],"text":"《兰斯》系列的魔王美树，早在1988年的《Little Vampire》里就当过女主角，也是TADA最早亲自创作的女主之一；后来他又把她带进了《兰斯》的世界。","title":"美树与《Little Vampire》"},{"id":"trivia-104","links":[{"id":"2112","kind":"work","text":"D.C."},{"id":"per_fw98b4aabfc4123c2dfe21e7de","kind":"person","text":"tororo"}],"number":104,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/191211a"],"text":"《D.C.》制作人tororo原本想去东京当职业麻将选手，被父母反对后，才转而选择了制作游戏。","title":"tororo与职业麻将"},{"id":"trivia-105","links":[{"id":"3007","kind":"work","text":"CROSS†CHANNEL"},{"id":"per_fw5da2bdc689f72829a80e9ca6","kind":"person","text":"taninon"}],"number":105,"sources":["https://www.aozora-biscuit.com/pokekoi/interview/pokekoi_taninon03.html"],"text":"《CROSS†CHANNEL》的片头，一个角色都没让出场；制作影片的taninon事后还惊讶这样居然能通过，当时上司的想法却很简单：“帅就可以。”","title":"《CROSS†CHANNEL》的片头"},{"id":"trivia-106","links":[{"id":"32666","kind":"work","text":"夏ノ終熄"},{"id":"12437","kind":"work","text":"夏ノ雨"},{"id":"2715","kind":"company","text":"CUBE"}],"number":106,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/89425/"],"text":"《夏ノ終熄》是CUBE的第十部作品，标题特意沿用了出道作《夏ノ雨》的“夏ノ”。","title":"《夏ノ終熄》的标题"},{"id":"trivia-107","links":[{"id":"per_fwa71d56d89df1664326d9d97d","kind":"person","text":"宅本うと"},{"id":"1937","kind":"company","text":"SMEE"},{"id":"509","kind":"company","text":"HOOKSOFT"}],"number":107,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/63671/"],"text":"SMEE刚成立时，为了不与HOOKSOFT争同一批玩家，曾考虑改做其他方向的成人游戏。宅本うと坚持做自己熟悉的纯爱，才有了后来这条品牌路线。","title":"SMEE的品牌路线"},{"id":"trivia-108","links":[{"id":"per_fw1c235c92477742bb7009f169","kind":"person","text":"天都"},{"id":"509","kind":"company","text":"HOOKSOFT"},{"id":"1511","kind":"company","text":"ASa Project"}],"number":108,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/63671/"],"text":"ASa Project的成员原本靠生活费和打工维持开发；加入HOOKSOFT集团时，天都最直观的感想却是：“每个月都有工资？太好了。”","title":"ASa Project加入HOOKSOFT"},{"id":"trivia-109","links":[{"id":"per_fw50ca1a3cd4ec4a36b75a2f7e","kind":"person","text":"下川直哉"},{"id":"per_fw2cd0e9d5b62b42dfb31ffe42","kind":"person","text":"折户伸治"},{"id":"316","kind":"company","text":"Leaf"},{"id":"83","kind":"company","text":"Key"},{"id":"644","kind":"company","text":"AQUAPLUS"}],"number":109,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/250325e"],"text":"AQUAPLUS的下川直哉与Key的折户伸治，高中时就通过电脑通信的音乐论坛认识了；当年一起交换自作曲的伙伴，后来成了Leaf早期的音乐班底。","title":"下川直哉与折户伸治"},{"id":"trivia-110","links":[{"id":"323","kind":"work","text":"雫"},{"id":"198","kind":"work","text":"痕"},{"id":"475","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart"},{"id":"13176","kind":"work","text":"心跳回忆"},{"id":"per_fw50ca1a3cd4ec4a36b75a2f7e","kind":"person","text":"下川直哉"},{"id":"316","kind":"company","text":"Leaf"}],"number":110,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/250325e/2"],"text":"Leaf接连做了《雫》《痕》两部猎奇悬疑作品，下一部《ToHeart》却转向了轻松的校园喜剧。这是下川直哉刻意安排的反差：他想让做阴暗故事的团队，正面挑战《心跳回忆》。","title":"从《雫》《痕》到《ToHeart》"},{"id":"trivia-111","links":[{"id":"per_fw50ca1a3cd4ec4a36b75a2f7e","kind":"person","text":"下川直哉"}],"number":111,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/250325e/3"],"text":"下川直哉年轻时在婚礼会场打工，负责灯光和放音乐，逐渐摸清了什么场面配什么曲子能让来宾落泪；后来做游戏配乐，这份经验也派上了用场。","title":"下川直哉与婚礼配乐"},{"id":"trivia-112","links":[{"id":"1954","kind":"work","text":"鬼哭街"},{"id":"per_fwbe4bc9c1aeb65759e4113afe","kind":"person","text":"虚渊玄"}],"number":112,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/130/G013023/20110617067/index_2.html"],"text":"《鬼哭街》里一些奇形怪状的中国兵器，参考过金庸小说卷末的兵器插图；虚渊玄尤其喜欢护手钩那种让人纳闷“到底怎么想出来的”造型。","title":"《鬼哭街》与金庸小说"},{"id":"trivia-113","links":[{"id":"633","kind":"work","text":"Phantom"},{"id":"475","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart"},{"id":"per_fwbe4bc9c1aeb65759e4113afe","kind":"person","text":"虚渊玄"}],"number":113,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/000/260/260281/index-2.html"],"text":"《Phantom》的Claudia路线，灵感之一来自《ToHeart》的志保结局；它让虚渊玄想到，恋爱故事未必一定要以两个人幸福结合收尾。","title":"《Phantom》与《ToHeart》"},{"id":"trivia-114","links":[{"id":"19333","kind":"work","text":"アストラエアの白き永遠"}],"number":114,"sources":["https://houkagomesitukai.hatenadiary.jp/entry/2025/07/29/143030"],"text":"《アストラエアの白き永遠》的雪々，最初设定是个大冬天还穿着夏装的神秘少女，后来才改成了带有和服风格的造型。","title":"雪々的服装设定"},{"id":"trivia-115","links":[{"id":"per_fwd404c1df73fc2db0137547f9","kind":"person","text":"马场隆博"},{"id":"3687","kind":"company","text":"Visual Arts"},{"id":"114","kind":"company","text":"SAGA PLANETS"}],"number":115,"sources":["https://akibablog.blog.jp/archives/51321557.html"],"text":"1997年，有人给Visual Arts打电话，想应聘企划和剧本工作；马场隆博聊着聊着，却建议他干脆自己带一个品牌，于是有了SAGA PLANETS。","title":"SAGA PLANETS的成立"},{"id":"trivia-116","links":[{"id":"757","kind":"work","text":"骸 ～メスを狙う顎～"},{"id":"114","kind":"company","text":"SAGA PLANETS"}],"number":116,"sources":["https://akibablog.blog.jp/archives/51321557.html"],"text":"以明亮可爱的恋爱游戏为人熟知的SAGA PLANETS，出道作却是1998年的阴暗系作品《骸 ～メスを狙う顎～》。","title":"SAGA PLANETS的出道作"},{"id":"trivia-117","links":[{"id":"2590","kind":"work","text":"Muv-Luv"},{"id":"per_fw04df8fbcad0f0997d0de752f","kind":"person","text":"吉宗钢纪"}],"number":117,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/778/G077853/20241112061/"],"text":"《Muv-Luv》里香月夕呼的一些训话，用的就是吉宗钢纪平时在公司讲的话；部分早期员工也因此不太喜欢这个角色。","title":"香月夕呼的台词"},{"id":"trivia-118","links":[{"id":"2590","kind":"work","text":"Muv-Luv"},{"id":"37963","kind":"work","text":"学园偶像大师"},{"id":"4286","kind":"work","text":"Muv-Luv Alternative"}],"number":118,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/778/G077853/20241112061/"],"text":"《学园偶像大师》制作人小美野日出文，在人生低谷时玩过《Muv-Luv Alternative》，被主角重新站起来的过程鼓舞。他后来直言，如果没有这部作品，自己就不会进入现在这个行业。","title":"小美野日出文与《Muv-Luv》"},{"id":"trivia-119","links":[{"id":"per_fw54fbf6aa141de319dcf08335","kind":"person","text":"新岛夕"},{"id":"6530","kind":"company","text":"GLOVETY"}],"number":119,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/21525/"],"text":"新岛夕把Gravity和Love拼成了品牌名GLOVETY。被问起理念，他先解释想做有爱、有吸引力的东西，又坦白其实没想那么远，先把游戏做出来再说。","title":"GLOVETY的名字"},{"id":"trivia-120","links":[{"id":"167","kind":"work","text":"无颜之月"},{"id":"per_fw8e031ed6c5eb56b5187d243d","kind":"person","text":"奏雨"},{"id":"per_fw9b811589467a4c6eac7eb445","kind":"person","text":"CARNELIAN"}],"number":120,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/interview/169666/"],"text":"奏雨曾被杂志封面上的可爱女孩吸引，翻开才发现是美少女游戏杂志，惊讶之余，又被CARNELIAN画的《无颜之月》广告迷住了。多年后，杂志叫什么早已忘记，那张画却一直记得；当时的她也没想到，自己后来会成为美少女游戏声优。","title":"奏雨与《无颜之月》"},{"id":"trivia-121","links":[{"id":"18111","kind":"work","text":"海市蜃楼之馆"},{"id":"per_fw13d702f750f273b3b6836e99","kind":"person","text":"縹けいか"}],"number":121,"sources":["https://www.cs.furyu.jp/kataruhito/fatamorgana/"],"text":"縹けいか最初做《海市蜃楼之馆》，只是想攒一份求职用的作品集；结果短篇越做越长，一做就是四年。","title":"《海市蜃楼之馆》的制作起点"},{"id":"trivia-122","links":[{"id":"18111","kind":"work","text":"海市蜃楼之馆"}],"number":122,"sources":["https://www.cs.furyu.jp/kataruhito/fatamorgana/"],"text":"《海市蜃楼之馆》做了四年，2012年冬Comiket首发却只卖出约170份。团队后来继续做免费短篇、办投票活动，作品才逐渐靠玩家口碑传开。","title":"《海市蜃楼之馆》的首发销量"},{"id":"trivia-123","links":[{"id":"18111","kind":"work","text":"海市蜃楼之馆"}],"number":123,"sources":["https://nydgamer.blogspot.com/2013/10/fatamorganainterview1.html"],"text":"《海市蜃楼之馆》的核心成员，是在网上玩文字角色扮演时认识的：大家各自扮演一个角色，用文字写出角色的对话和行动。发现会写故事、画画、做音乐的人正好凑齐了，他们便决定一起做游戏。","title":"《海市蜃楼之馆》团队的相识"},{"id":"trivia-124","links":[{"id":"18111","kind":"work","text":"海市蜃楼之馆"}],"number":124,"sources":["https://nydgamer.blogspot.com/2013/10/fatamorganainterview2.html"],"text":"《海市蜃楼之馆》第四章里，玩家刚在剧情中读到的某些文字，打开历史记录回看时，却会显示成另一种内容。这是制作组故意留下的线索：连回看台词的功能，都在暗示眼前的故事并非真相。","title":"《海市蜃楼之馆》的历史记录"},{"id":"trivia-125","links":[{"id":"2006","kind":"work","text":"兰斯4.1"},{"id":"2007","kind":"work","text":"兰斯4.2"},{"id":"2007","kind":"work","text":"4.2"}],"number":125,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2023/03/blog-post_30.html"],"text":"《兰斯4.1》《4.2》原本想做成便宜、短小的独立冒险，顺利的话就继续出4.3、4.4、4.5。结果前两作连故事都没能各自讲完，反倒像是上下篇。","title":"《兰斯4.1》与《兰斯4.2》"},{"id":"trivia-126","links":[{"id":"527","kind":"company","text":"minori"}],"number":126,"sources":["https://game.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/interview/1272247.html"],"text":"minori直到2019年才宣布结束软件制作，但早约五年前就做出了决定；中间这几年，主要用来安排成员离开公司后的去处。","title":"minori结束软件制作"},{"id":"trivia-127","links":[{"id":"9023","kind":"work","text":"电脑学园"},{"id":"6946","kind":"work","text":"美少女梦工厂"},{"id":"per_fw580fd45e0fdb8c43c22f3181","kind":"person","text":"赤井孝美"}],"number":127,"sources":["https://saninpedia.com/akaitakami"],"text":"赤井孝美看完《飞跃巅峰！》第二集的社内试映，觉得自己在这类动画上比不过庵野秀明，便开始另找方向；后来，他做出了《电脑学园》和《美少女梦工厂》。","title":"赤井孝美与《飞跃巅峰！》"},{"id":"trivia-128","links":[],"number":128,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/000/488/488268/"],"text":"Galgame里常见的失忆设定，能让主角和刚开始玩的玩家一样，对眼前的世界一无所知；同伴给主角解释背景，也就顺便把世界观讲给了玩家。","title":"失忆主角"},{"id":"trivia-129","links":[{"id":"5424","kind":"work","text":"Ever17"},{"id":"per_fwd7b173f82a1d17d3cd26c43f","kind":"person","text":"中泽工"},{"id":"619","kind":"company","text":"KID"}],"number":129,"sources":["https://adayem.wordpress.com/2018/04/27/infinity-plus-premium-interview/"],"text":"《Ever17》的田中优美清春香菜，名字这么长，是故意让她不必总报全名；中泽工在姓名网站找到了这个名字，还正好符合KID女主角名字以“ゆ”开头的惯例。","title":"《Ever17》中优的名字"},{"id":"trivia-131","links":[{"id":"5804","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart2"},{"id":"per_fw50ca1a3cd4ec4a36b75a2f7e","kind":"person","text":"下川直哉"}],"number":131,"sources":["https://aquaplus.jp/ttt2/specialtalk/page2.html"],"text":"《ToHeart2》里，柚原木实穿着不同校服、在校门口等学长放学，这一幕是下川直哉高中时见过的。不过，被低一届女友等着的人，是他的朋友。","title":"柚原木实的放学场景"},{"id":"trivia-132","links":[{"id":"14792","kind":"work","text":"弹丸论破"},{"id":"per_fw8e17d6483a8ae91d64d95789","kind":"person","text":"小高和刚"}],"number":132,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/190110/2"],"text":"小高和刚常常忘记写过的台词，偶尔看到网上的《弹丸论破》名台词合集，反而会惊讶：这么好的句子，居然是自己写的？","title":"小高和刚与名台词合集"},{"id":"trivia-133","links":[{"id":"10917","kind":"work","text":"Rewrite"},{"id":"per_fw8c87571680d5ed0efbe40090","kind":"person","text":"樋上至"}],"number":133,"sources":["https://gigazine.net/news/20110626_key_rewrite_interview_itaru/"],"text":"画《Rewrite》时，樋上至看不懂“千早滚过来后挂在树上”是什么姿势，便请编剧站上椅子，亲自摆给她看。连咲夜那些耍帅的姿势，也有编剧先演过一遍，再由她画到角色身上。","title":"《Rewrite》的动作示范"},{"id":"trivia-134","links":[{"id":"29089","kind":"work","text":"ATRI"},{"id":"per_fw460a718829bbe499fa37474d","kind":"person","text":"绀野Asta"},{"id":"275","kind":"company","text":"Frontwing"}],"number":134,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202009/12203282.html"],"text":"绀野Asta收到Aniplex的邀约邮件，第一反应是恶作剧。后来准备入职Frontwing，他一度想推掉这个项目，结果《ATRI》反倒成了他在新公司的第一份工作。","title":"《ATRI》的邀约"},{"id":"trivia-135","links":[{"id":"3274","kind":"work","text":"斗神都市"},{"id":"per_fweef040970d87ef5896f22d66","kind":"person","text":"TADA"}],"number":135,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/237/G023755/20131121064/index_2.html"],"text":"初代《斗神都市》的企划，是TADA花一两天临时想出来救场的：原定游戏被否决了，得赶紧找个新项目顶上。","title":"初代《斗神都市》的企划"},{"id":"trivia-136","links":[{"id":"1610","kind":"work","text":"月姬"},{"id":"per_fw97778e13b53b3dacf8bf7d18","kind":"person","text":"奈须蘑菇"},{"id":"per_fwc768752672573b37ce9d58d4","kind":"person","text":"武内崇"}],"number":136,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202109/11232354.html"],"text":"重制《月姬》前，奈须蘑菇和武内崇各自重玩旧作，把不满意的地方记下来，再带着笔记一起合宿，专门挑自己旧作的毛病。","title":"《月姬》的重玩合宿"},{"id":"trivia-137","links":[{"id":"per_fw05950c5fec30be6fa3fa4279","kind":"person","text":"I’ve"}],"number":137,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999905/20210705029/"],"text":"I’ve最初是给美少女游戏品牌取的名字，日语读音以「あ」开头，能排在杂志目录前面。后来游戏没做成，这个名字却被音乐团队沿用了下来。","title":"I’ve的名字"},{"id":"trivia-138","links":[{"id":"per_fwda970b89e3a33b1696005898","kind":"person","text":"KOTOKO"}],"number":138,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999905/20210705029/"],"text":"KOTOKO还没以这个名字发表游戏歌曲，就已经作为Outer的“神秘主唱”出道了。那支乐队走朋克路线，和她原本想做的风格不同，于是先换了个招牌。","title":"KOTOKO与Outer"},{"id":"trivia-139","links":[{"id":"per_fwda970b89e3a33b1696005898","kind":"person","text":"KOTOKO"},{"id":"per_fwb4ef5d127d3dfcc5365cc8dd","kind":"person","text":"高濑一矢"},{"id":"per_fw05950c5fec30be6fa3fa4279","kind":"person","text":"I’ve"}],"number":139,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999905/20210705029/"],"text":"I’ve录音时，也会轮到歌手KOTOKO坐在控制台前，让团队的高濑一矢进录音间唱歌。《ねぇ、…しようよ！》的Outer混音版里，高濑的声音就是她录的，唱得不合适还得听她喊重来。","title":"KOTOKO的录音工作"},{"id":"trivia-140","links":[{"id":"185","kind":"work","text":"カナリア"},{"id":"per_fwc31983183d989c4fde872e7a","kind":"person","text":"佐藤裕美"},{"id":"275","kind":"company","text":"Frontwing"}],"number":140,"sources":["https://ascii.jp/elem/000/000/327/327091/"],"text":"1999年冬Comiket，佐藤裕美在摊位卖乐队CD，正为《カナリア》找歌手的Frontwing社长听完问：“这是谁唱的？”站在面前的她举起了手，后来便接到了第一份游戏歌曲工作。","title":"佐藤裕美与《カナリア》"},{"id":"trivia-141","links":[{"id":"per_fw714ce549194d48cae69339fc","kind":"person","text":"るび様"}],"number":141,"sources":["https://note.com/asahipac_press/n/n881f0c6b2b1d"],"text":"原画师るび様笔名里的“様”也是名字的一部分，所以别人称呼她时，还会再加一个“老师”。至于“るび”，取自第37号元素铷的日文名“ルビジウム”。","title":"るび様的笔名"},{"id":"trivia-142","links":[{"id":"36205","kind":"work","text":"播种之谣"},{"id":"per_fwf7c2b941b9d07466913b5ba7","kind":"person","text":"Kazuki"}],"number":142,"sources":["https://www.famitsu.com/news/202404/13338100.html"],"text":"Kazuki在祖母家翻到母亲小时候的照片和涂鸦，忽然想：要是留着胡子的自己穿越过去，对少女时代的母亲说“我是你儿子”，她会是什么反应？《播种之谣》里同龄祖孙三代一起冒险的故事，就有了这样一个起点。","title":"《播种之谣》的起点"},{"id":"trivia-143","links":[{"id":"28634","kind":"work","text":"MUSICUS!"},{"id":"25166","kind":"work","text":"BLACK SHEEP TOWN"},{"id":"per_fw61ae98896143cf850770557c","kind":"person","text":"濑户口廉也"}],"number":143,"sources":["https://automaton-media.com/articles/interviewsjp/20240427-290991/"],"text":"《BLACK SHEEP TOWN》的剧本早于《MUSICUS!》写完，却迟迟等不齐美术等素材。濑户口廉也觉得不能一直干等，便趁这段空当又写了《MUSICUS!》。","title":"《MUSICUS!》的制作顺序"},{"id":"trivia-144","links":[{"id":"37571","kind":"work","text":"将花朵献与你"},{"id":"37571","kind":"work","text":"将花朵献与你-Kinsenka-"},{"id":"per_fw49c3b4fa111a6db4df82543a","kind":"person","text":"漆原雪人"}],"number":144,"sources":["https://realsound.jp/tech/2025/05/post-2018708.html"],"text":"《将花朵献与你-Kinsenka-》原定做成中价作品，漆原雪人却越写越多，制作组索性让他放开写。最后剧本长到约80万字，有一般中价作品的两倍左右，他还觉得没写够。","title":"《将花朵献与你》的篇幅"},{"id":"trivia-145","links":[{"id":"17943","kind":"work","text":"学☆王"}],"number":145,"sources":["https://www.gamer.ne.jp/news/201304130001/"],"text":"《学☆王》移植PSP时，多了一位女主角，副标题却仍保留着SEVEN（七）。新加的“+METEOR”指的就是她，连Logo也跟着多了一颗星。","title":"《学☆王》的“+METEOR”"},{"id":"trivia-146","links":[{"id":"per_fwd9b06662cb286e9cecd097b9","kind":"person","text":"霜月遥"}],"number":146,"sources":["https://www.animatetimes.com/news/details.php?id=1352776649"],"text":"霜月遥录《压倒性的游戏：无限灵魂》的歌曲时，看见录音室里摆着自己的吉祥物玩偶，随口问它能不能进游戏。制作组不但答应了，还给它安排了一个Boss的位置。","title":"霜月遥的吉祥物"},{"id":"trivia-147","links":[{"id":"509","kind":"company","text":"HOOKSOFT"}],"number":147,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/15203/"],"text":"HOOKSOFT最初由两个同人社团合并而成：一边擅长程序，缺美术和剧本；另一边恰好相反。被同一家发行商看中后，两边干脆凑到一起做游戏。","title":"HOOKSOFT的组建"},{"id":"trivia-148","links":[{"id":"2803","kind":"work","text":"Orange Pocket"},{"id":"509","kind":"company","text":"HOOKSOFT"}],"number":148,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/15203/"],"text":"在HOOKSOFT的《Orange Pocket》中，玩家选择选项花费的时间，也会影响女主角的反应。","title":"《Orange Pocket》的回答时机"},{"id":"trivia-149","links":[{"id":"3542","kind":"work","text":"LikeLife"},{"id":"10853","kind":"work","text":"FairlyLife"},{"id":"23859","kind":"work","text":"Amenity's Life"},{"id":"509","kind":"company","text":"HOOKSOFT"}],"number":149,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/15203/"],"text":"HOOKSOFT在《LikeLife》《FairlyLife》《Amenity's Life》里，都把手机变成过女主角。现实里的手机更新换代，游戏里的女主角也从普通手机升级成了智能手机。","title":"HOOKSOFT的手机女主角"},{"id":"trivia-150","links":[{"id":"12797","kind":"work","text":"命运石之门"},{"id":"per_fw944e343612b62895af4988a8","kind":"person","text":"志仓千代丸"},{"id":"vndb:p146","kind":"company","text":"MAGES."}],"number":150,"sources":["https://www.animatetimes.com/news/details.php?id=1664409801"],"text":"《夏日重现》的作者田中靖规玩《命运石之门》时，也会配上一罐Dr Pepper，后来还把它画进了漫画番外。MAGES.的工作人员认出了这位同好，干脆安排他和志仓千代丸对谈。","title":"《夏日重现》里的Dr Pepper"},{"id":"trivia-151","links":[{"id":"per_fw85399a87533169e3203bd777","kind":"person","text":"片冈智"}],"number":151,"sources":["https://www.gamer.ne.jp/news/202407170001/"],"text":"片冈智写剧本时，连玩家点了几次鼠标都算：一个话题隔了大约两次点击再提起，就重新写出名字，不再用“这个”代指，免得玩家已经忘了。","title":"片冈智的两次点击"},{"id":"trivia-152","links":[{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉"},{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉鸣泣之时"},{"id":"per_fw36d541cb5e909dc81f546c0b","kind":"person","text":"龙骑士07"}],"number":152,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/001/577/1577295/"],"text":"《寒蝉鸣泣之时》最初没做选项，龙骑士07还答应过玩家，完整版会补上。可他每次都更想先写下一篇，写到《祟杀篇》以后，干脆宣布“没有选项”就是作品特色。","title":"《寒蝉》的选项"},{"id":"trivia-153","links":[{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉"},{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉鸣泣之时"}],"number":153,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/001/577/1577295/"],"text":"《寒蝉鸣泣之时》的早期体验版只让玩家玩《鬼隐篇》，文件里却还留着《绵流篇》和《祟杀篇》的剧本。有人翻出后续故事，消息便在玩家之间传开了。","title":"《寒蝉》体验版里的后续剧本"},{"id":"trivia-154","links":[{"id":"per_fweef040970d87ef5896f22d66","kind":"person","text":"TADA"}],"number":154,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2021/09/1992.html"],"text":"沙织事件后的1992年，成人游戏厂商人人自危，25岁的TADA跑到软件行业协会求助，希望有人订出明确规则。听他陈情的理事长是孙正义；不久后，TADA便被叫去参与筹建软件伦理机构。","title":"TADA与孙正义"},{"id":"trivia-155","links":[{"id":"23281","kind":"work","text":"人狼村之谜"},{"id":"per_fw75bf7cdf7689c0193090caf7","kind":"person","text":"あんひびあん"}],"number":155,"sources":["https://www.gamer.ne.jp/news/202602190031"],"text":"《超时空辉夜姬！》那艘竹笋形宇宙飞船的名字，出自《人狼村之谜》的编剧あんひびあん；导演玩这部游戏玩得入迷，后来把他请来参与设定，连飞船如何伪装成竹子都有了科幻解释。","title":"《超时空辉夜姬！》的竹笋飞船"},{"id":"trivia-156","links":[{"id":"39470","kind":"work","text":"游魂零"},{"id":"1466","kind":"company","text":"Lump of Sugar"}],"number":156,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/242376/"],"text":"《游魂零》早在初代Fan Book的访谈里就有过构想，后来又几次作为愚人节“发售消息”登场。到了Lump of Sugar二十周年，这个多年的玩笑终于变成了正式企划。","title":"《游魂零》的愚人节"},{"id":"trivia-157","links":[{"id":"33209","kind":"work","text":"废村少女"},{"id":"per_fw48ec60c9e869cc36e3723e33","kind":"person","text":"薄迷"}],"number":157,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/272140/"],"text":"《废村少女》的编剧薄迷，大学学的就是民俗学。他把学过的日本风俗、民间传说和自己爱看的废墟照片放到一起，写出了游戏里那座藏着谜团的村子。","title":"《废村少女》与民俗学"},{"id":"trivia-158","links":[{"id":"per_fwe1f9f7b8ff9664f01f922382","kind":"person","text":"柚原みう"}],"number":158,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/interview/255552/"],"text":"柚原みう刚入行时，信了网上“成人场景里的口部音效由专门的大叔负责”的传闻，还认真问录音时是不是要和大叔搭档——结果根本没有这个人，得自己来。","title":"柚原みう与网络传闻"},{"id":"trivia-159","links":[{"id":"16531","kind":"work","text":"春开，意遥遥。"},{"id":"per_fwef6052e7281ec3fe36979c74","kind":"person","text":"渡边僚一"}],"number":159,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/174176/"],"text":"渡边僚一原想告别游戏业，去编辑公司找写作工作，偏偏对方的游戏编剧跑了，只留下四张女主角立绘和五张事件原画。他又接下这份只给四个月工期的工作，写成了《春开，意遥遥。》。","title":"《春开，意遥遥。》的接手"},{"id":"trivia-160","links":[{"id":"per_fwf164797397231a6ea1af51ac","kind":"person","text":"Ayumi."}],"number":160,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/180670/"],"text":"Ayumi.留学时给iPod装了约五百首日语歌，最后却只顾着循环UNDER17的两张专辑。回国后被问起出道想唱什么，她的答案很干脆：电波歌。","title":"Ayumi.与电波歌"},{"id":"trivia-161","links":[{"id":"36054","kind":"work","text":"万千定数孤注破晓之刻"},{"id":"per_fwd6181b625b19a2df221f5bec","kind":"person","text":"うろ"}],"number":161,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/169169/"],"text":"《万千定数孤注破晓之刻》的原画师うろ接到“魔剑士”的设定，画出了一位恶魔般阴沉的女剑士，交稿时才知道，对方想要的只是“会用魔法的剑士”。","title":"《万千定数孤注破晓之刻》的魔剑士"},{"id":"trivia-162","links":[{"id":"per_fwe4353a2e5bf492103c2e8e64","kind":"person","text":"保住圭"}],"number":162,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/135277/"],"text":"保住圭原本想当漫画家，和同学合作做游戏时，却接下了写剧本的活。游戏最终没做成，他把那段时间写的剧本寄给游戏公司，反而以编剧的身份入了行。","title":"保住圭的第一份剧本"},{"id":"trivia-163","links":[{"id":"26724","kind":"work","text":"拔作岛"},{"id":"per_fw7c2f2fb60808495aaae0fa39","kind":"person","text":"水野七海"}],"number":163,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/267324/"],"text":"水野七海接到《拔作岛》的配音工作时，看标题和资料，以为只是部胡闹搞笑的成人游戏。读了台本才意识到，自己配的角色可能会让玩家感动得哭出来。","title":"水野七海与《拔作岛》"},{"id":"trivia-164","links":[{"id":"13098","kind":"work","text":"心跳回忆4"}],"number":164,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/085/G008587/20090925081/"],"text":"《心跳回忆4》的故事发生在初代十五年后，制作组却犯了难：玩家真的想见到三十多岁的藤崎诗织吗？最后只留下她在校园里的足迹，没有让长大后的本人登场。","title":"《心跳回忆4》的诗织"},{"id":"trivia-165","links":[{"id":"10189","kind":"work","text":"学校发生过的恐怖故事"},{"id":"per_fw67e4591b4e62173ac793efb8","kind":"person","text":"海原望"},{"id":"per_fwbeda0cf9202142e9a6d3e641","kind":"person","text":"Lia"},{"id":"307","kind":"company","text":"Liar-soft"}],"number":165,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/126229/"],"text":"海原望还是Liar-soft的美工时，给同人版《学校发生过的恐怖故事》投稿怪谈，却被邀请去写剧本。社长也支持她接下，于是她的第一份有偿编剧工作，反倒来自自家公司之外。","title":"海原望的第一份有偿剧本"},{"id":"trivia-166","links":[{"id":"4887","kind":"work","text":"娇蛮之吻"},{"id":"per_fw100ad5d8a99c87b2d2777f08","kind":"person","text":"かずきふみ"},{"id":"47","kind":"company","text":"Interheart"},{"id":"1194","kind":"company","text":"CandySoft"}],"number":166,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/122893/"],"text":"かずきふみ刚入行，以为自己进了做《娇蛮之吻》的CandySoft，还没弄明白那只是Interheart旗下的一个品牌。等被分去写同公司的痴汉游戏，他才傻了眼。","title":"かずきふみ入职时的误会"},{"id":"trivia-167","links":[{"id":"28526","kind":"work","text":"星光咖啡馆与死神之蝶"},{"id":"per_fw100ad5d8a99c87b2d2777f08","kind":"person","text":"かずきふみ"},{"id":"1795","kind":"company","text":"柚子社"}],"number":167,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/122893/"],"text":"柚子社请かずきふみ写《星光咖啡馆与死神之蝶》，他看完邮件却以为是恶作剧：柚子社怎么会找自己，邮箱名还这么奇怪？一查域名，偏偏又和柚子社客服的一模一样。","title":"柚子社的邀约邮件"},{"id":"trivia-168","links":[{"id":"33865","kind":"work","text":"琉璃樱"},{"id":"per_fw4f9696026cb055675beda1a7","kind":"person","text":"雪仁"},{"id":"per_fw0c0f56b8df59e26acf66c7f8","kind":"person","text":"萌木原ふみたけ"}],"number":168,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/113561/"],"text":"《琉璃樱》最初想写荒废的未来世界，请来萌木原ふみたけ画原画后，雪仁却觉得：既然是他，兽耳少女和巫女服怎么能少？为了容纳这些元素，连时代背景也一起改了。","title":"《琉璃樱》的时代背景"},{"id":"trivia-169","links":[{"id":"per_fw772981e80d1cd3b5cbcce628","kind":"person","text":"小波すず"}],"number":169,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/110464/"],"text":"小波すず录音会带毛绒玩具，把录音间布置成自己熟悉的“小房间”。工作人员在外面反复检查录音，她就在里面摸摸玩具，免得越等越紧张。","title":"小波すず的录音间"},{"id":"trivia-170","links":[{"id":"23274","kind":"work","text":"幕末尽忠报国烈士传 MIBURO"},{"id":"per_fw9f358e9310d626ed0d4b796a","kind":"person","text":"飴川紫乃"}],"number":170,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/120185/"],"text":"飴川紫乃在声优学校习惯了站着练习，初次给《幕末尽忠报国烈士传 MIBURO》配音时，却要坐着录音，怎么也找不到大声喊战斗台词的感觉。最后经纪人与录音方协调，让她改成站着录。","title":"飴川紫乃的首次录音"},{"id":"trivia-171","links":[{"id":"24608","kind":"work","text":"猫忍之心"}],"number":171,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/67591/"],"text":"《猫忍之心》从企划起就考虑了海外玩家：猫耳受欢迎，再加上代表日本的忍者，于是有了猫耳忍者。","title":"《猫忍之心》的题材"},{"id":"trivia-172","links":[{"id":"29032","kind":"work","text":"一生推不如一生恋"},{"id":"per_fw71b29024583f4b6879506b91","kind":"person","text":"北大路ゆき"}],"number":172,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/117008/"],"text":"北大路ゆき以前配恋爱戏，恋爱对象都是没配音的男主角；到了百合游戏《一生推不如一生恋》，对方终于也有了声音。","title":"北大路ゆき的恋爱对象"},{"id":"trivia-173","links":[{"id":"7842","kind":"work","text":"ふぃぎゅ@メイト"},{"id":"per_fw87014749a00f99486dc9d9c5","kind":"person","text":"みたかりん"}],"number":173,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/interview/250823/"],"text":"みたかりん小时候，父亲就会在车里放《鸟之诗》，也会放《ふぃぎゅ@メイト》的主题曲。后来她成了美少女游戏声优，还给父亲买了自己的出道作，父亲却不好意思玩女儿配音的成人场景。","title":"みたかりん与父亲"},{"id":"trivia-174","links":[{"id":"32004","kind":"work","text":"AMBITIOUS MISSION"},{"id":"per_fweea5f11f400fe8cbe0546f81","kind":"person","text":"榎本ねむ"}],"number":174,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/interview/235951/"],"text":"榎本ねむ一直想演元气又没什么脑筋的角色，终于接到了《AMBITIOUS MISSION》的夏洛特。演得太尽兴时，工作人员反倒要提醒她：刚才笨过头了，请收一点。","title":"《AMBITIOUS MISSION》的夏洛特"},{"id":"trivia-175","links":[{"id":"per_fwea35e412b1b8dcc5151ea021","kind":"person","text":"乙仓由依"}],"number":175,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/243098/"],"text":"乙仓由依给角色配音时，想演出母亲般的温柔，却怎么都找不准感觉：温柔一点像同班同学，爽朗一点又像大阪大妈。直到录音师提醒她“想想你平时怎么哄猫”，她才明白该怎么演。","title":"乙仓由依的母性演技"},{"id":"trivia-176","links":[{"id":"26206","kind":"work","text":"白色相簿2"},{"id":"per_fweec9bb1efe06d32e91c7f2a5","kind":"person","text":"中村毅"},{"id":"per_fwa8e8c188992ed12ed7437db7","kind":"person","text":"丸户史明"}],"number":176,"sources":["https://www.4gamer.net/games/186/G018635/20121215001/index_2.html"],"text":"中村毅给《白色相簿2》画冬马和纱时，曾紧张地问丸户史明：她要剪头发吗？丸户赶紧让他放心，剧本里根本没打算让她剪。","title":"冬马和纱的长发"},{"id":"trivia-177","links":[{"id":"per_fw49c3b4fa111a6db4df82543a","kind":"person","text":"漆原雪人"}],"number":177,"sources":["https://realsound.jp/tech/2025/05/post-2018708.html","https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/H-GAME/M.1658755148.A.DFE","https://bangumi.tv/subject/233030/reviews/5.html"],"text":"常被玩家抱怨剧本冗长的漆原雪人，却自认为更擅长写短篇。","title":"漆原雪人的长篇剧本"},{"id":"trivia-178","links":[{"id":"per_fw8f0bd4ab12bf5c23e7cf40a3","kind":"person","text":"伊ヶ崎绫香"}],"number":178,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/198675/"],"text":"伊ヶ崎绫香录音时曾遇到怎么查设备都找不到来源的杂音，直到某天深吸一口气，才发现是内衣钢圈在响。此后，她录音就改穿不带钢圈的内搭了。","title":"伊ヶ崎绫香的录音杂音"},{"id":"trivia-179","links":[{"id":"per_fw79d6a9c490f5e885ef84b8af","kind":"person","text":"相模恋"}],"number":179,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/192881/"],"text":"相模恋原本是口腔保健师，给孩子们讲自制的防蛀牙故事时，发现自己很喜欢演角色。一次患病经历让她下定决心，用工作攒下的钱去念了声优学校。","title":"相模恋的转行"},{"id":"trivia-180","links":[{"id":"per_fw1f36682d8b692663a6a55ab0","kind":"person","text":"赤月ゆむ"}],"number":180,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/188057/"],"text":"赤月ゆむ当上声优后，还在美少女游戏店打工，连自己的出演作也一起卖。她还会给店内宣传牌签名，营造“声优本人来店”的感觉——其实本人就在这儿上班。","title":"赤月ゆむ的游戏店工作"},{"id":"trivia-181","links":[{"id":"per_fw818a2bfb37589bcec8e021ad","kind":"person","text":"白月かなめ"}],"number":181,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/146989/"],"text":"白月かなめ买录音时穿的衣服，会先连着衣架抖一抖，检查衣料会不会发出沙沙声，免得录音时连衣服摩擦的声音也被录进去。","title":"白月かなめ买衣服"},{"id":"trivia-182","links":[{"id":"per_fw36925145b2500ea6cd29db45","kind":"person","text":"结城ほのか"}],"number":182,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/interview/143460/"],"text":"结城ほのか冲着“以后会有动画配音的机会”进了事务所，结果接到的却多是旁白和舞台剧。事务所让她“现在先忍耐”，她想的却是：我明明是想说“欧尼酱”的啊。","title":"结城ほのか想说的台词"},{"id":"trivia-183","links":[{"id":"27525","kind":"work","text":"在月之彼岸邂逅"},{"id":"per_fw2c08bd41e477842c58e7b906","kind":"person","text":"くすはらゆい"}],"number":183,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/interview/153795/"],"text":"くすはらゆい录《在月之彼岸邂逅》的佐仓雨音，哭得眼泪直往台本上掉。她边演边担心滴答声会被录进去，可没人喊停，就这么继续演了下去。","title":"《在月之彼岸邂逅》的眼泪"},{"id":"trivia-184","links":[{"id":"4248","kind":"work","text":"日在校园"}],"number":184,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/64224/"],"text":"《日在校园》曾举办联动活动，把一辆救护车改装成鬼屋，让游客扮演伊藤诚。原班声优还为活动重新录了台词。","title":"《日在校园》的鬼屋"},{"id":"trivia-185","links":[],"number":185,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/event/140126/"],"text":"没拿到Comiket展位的厂商，曾聚在漫展前一天另办“电气外祭”，于是有了“Comiket第零天”的叫法。参展费也曾用一张新绘插画抵付。","title":"电气外祭的参展费"},{"id":"trivia-186","links":[{"id":"10082","kind":"work","text":"壳之少女"},{"id":"per_fw57d7b0ecbc9e4d0b5036df7e","kind":"person","text":"杉菜水姬"}],"number":186,"sources":["https://www.kinokuniya.co.jp/f/dsg-01-9784862526991"],"text":"《壳之少女》的原画师杉菜水姬，在画美少女游戏之前，想当的是职业拳击手。","title":"杉菜水姬的职业志向"},{"id":"trivia-187","links":[{"id":"8134","kind":"work","text":"战国兰斯"}],"number":187,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2019/07/18.html"],"text":"《战国兰斯》最初是按能在地图上四处冒险的RPG开发的，早期企划的第一章题为“黄金之国”。后来才改成了玩家熟悉的攻城略地、统一全国。","title":"《战国兰斯》的早期类型"},{"id":"trivia-188","links":[{"id":"35267","kind":"work","text":"创造世界的空想理论"},{"id":"per_fw70352ab7e2212c6549f25196","kind":"person","text":"近江谷宥"}],"number":188,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/146318/"],"text":"近江谷宥一直想写异世界转生，每次开企划会，至少要交一个异世界方案。提了这么多次，终于在《创造世界的空想理论》里写上了。","title":"《创造世界的空想理论》的异世界"},{"id":"trivia-189","links":[{"id":"15929","kind":"work","text":"君与彼女与彼女之恋"},{"id":"15929","kind":"work","text":"君与彼女与彼女之恋。"}],"number":189,"sources":["https://www.nitroplus.co.jp/game/totono/interview/01.php"],"text":"《君与彼女与彼女之恋。》最初想做一部“我和她，你到底选谁”的热闹喜剧。后来风格一变，葵的人设几乎推倒重来，基本只保住了发色。","title":"《君与彼女与彼女之恋》的初稿人设"},{"id":"trivia-190","links":[{"id":"20831","kind":"work","text":"少女谱写的爱的咏叹调"},{"id":"per_fwca10428d9db205ede6fabbf0","kind":"person","text":"月野きいろ"}],"number":190,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/140237/"],"text":"月野きいろ接《少女谱写的爱的咏叹调》，听说能演主要角色，就高兴地以为自己当上了女主角，拿到的人设也确实很可爱。结果她配的，是男扮女装的男主角。","title":"月野きいろ的主角邀约"},{"id":"trivia-191","links":[{"id":"22476","kind":"work","text":"少女领域"},{"id":"per_fw731065621979d1b0eabeaf18","kind":"person","text":"步サラ"}],"number":191,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/131727/"],"text":"步サラ曾在自己的YouTube频道，为配过的角色办了一次人气投票。遥遥领先拿到第一名的，是《少女领域》的男主角飞鸟凑。","title":"步サラ的角色人气投票"},{"id":"trivia-192","links":[{"id":"12923","kind":"work","text":"巨乳幻想"},{"id":"per_fw660961812d351953dc3c6ed3","kind":"person","text":"镜裕之"},{"id":"334","kind":"company","text":"Waffle"}],"number":192,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/171348/"],"text":"镜裕之本来打电话去婉拒Waffle的剧本邀约，却顺口提到：巨乳题材和奇幻世界很搭。对方马上请他写成企划书，一通推掉工作的电话，反倒带来了《巨乳幻想》。","title":"《巨乳幻想》的企划电话"},{"id":"trivia-193","links":[{"id":"13645","kind":"work","text":"さくらビットマップ"},{"id":"per_fwe01a1726b427015310c515cb","kind":"person","text":"樱城なお"},{"id":"509","kind":"company","text":"HOOKSOFT"}],"number":193,"sources":["https://www.bugbug.news/b_game/52568/"],"text":"樱城なお还没加入HOOKSOFT时，曾作为玩家参加《さくらビットマップ》的宣传活动，见到亜佐美晶正和玩家热聊；后来进了公司，当年活动上见到的人就成了他的上司。","title":"樱城なお与未来的上司"},{"id":"trivia-194","links":[{"id":"per_fwb6582e2ff2f6d80a74e3ff7d","kind":"person","text":"片雾烈火"}],"number":194,"sources":["https://repotama.com/2020/03/126705/"],"text":"片雾烈火担心一直靠唱歌生活，缺少普通工作的经验，特地去做过服务业兼职。学来的收钱、找钱方式，后来倒是派上了用场：去同人展摆摊。","title":"片雾烈火的打工经历"},{"id":"trivia-195","links":[{"id":"185","kind":"work","text":"カナリア"},{"id":"1616","kind":"work","text":"钟之音学园"},{"id":"per_fwe975176397e0e12f76b4b1da","kind":"person","text":"桑岛由一"}],"number":195,"sources":["https://note.com/narima01/n/nc7f4ec65222c"],"text":"写过《カナリア》《钟之音学园》的桑岛由一，早年给偶像杂志《BOMB》投稿插画，每个月寄约50张。编辑最后干脆给了他工作：知道了，别再寄这么多了。","title":"桑岛由一的插画投稿"},{"id":"trivia-196","links":[{"id":"14858","kind":"work","text":"兰斯Quest"},{"id":"16569","kind":"work","text":"Magnum"},{"id":"per_fweef040970d87ef5896f22d66","kind":"person","text":"TADA"}],"number":196,"sources":["https://hannylaboratory.blogspot.com/2020/01/blog-post.html"],"text":"《兰斯Quest》推出资料片《Magnum》后，旧结局已经接不上新剧情，TADA却舍不得删。后来的整合版便留了条岔路，让玩家也能拐去看看那个作废的结局。","title":"《兰斯Quest》留下的旧结局"},{"id":"trivia-197","links":[{"id":"3007","kind":"work","text":"CROSS†CHANNEL"},{"id":"per_fw04dcfc642504914c284f4325","kind":"person","text":"田中罗密欧"}],"number":197,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/000/871/871319/"],"text":"田中罗密欧很喜欢眼镜娘，偏偏越想把她们写好，就越拖到最后，结果反而没时间了。《CROSS†CHANNEL》的见里就吃过这个亏，他只好提醒自己：下次早点写眼镜娘。","title":"田中罗密欧与眼镜娘"},{"id":"trivia-198","links":[{"id":"26206","kind":"work","text":"白色相簿2"},{"id":"5804","kind":"work","text":"ToHeart2"},{"id":"per_fw62d3f7524ca6b78dced3e420","kind":"person","text":"米泽圆"},{"id":"per_fwb36de37dc9e02816bbf997d0","kind":"person","text":"生天目仁美"}],"number":198,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/000/573/573542/"],"text":"《白色相簿2》里给雪菜配音的米泽圆，也试演过和纱，演到一半就被叫停；给和纱配音的生天目仁美试演雪菜，却演出了《ToHeart2》十波由真的感觉。","title":"《白色相簿2》的试音"},{"id":"trivia-199","links":[{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉鸣泣之时"},{"id":"per_fw36d541cb5e909dc81f546c0b","kind":"person","text":"龙骑士07"}],"number":199,"sources":["https://sai-zen-sen.jp/works/extras/faust07higurashi/01/01.html"],"text":"《寒蝉鸣泣之时》的读者曾认定，龙骑士07一定很喜欢推理作家京极夏彦。可“京极夏彦”这个名字，他恰恰是听粉丝提起才知道的。","title":"龙骑士07与京极夏彦"},{"id":"trivia-200","links":[{"id":"4136","kind":"work","text":"寒蝉"},{"id":"per_fw36d541cb5e909dc81f546c0b","kind":"person","text":"龙骑士07"}],"number":200,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/001/577/1577295/"],"text":"龙骑士07曾在世嘉土星上用游戏制作工具写故事，没有键盘，就用手柄方向键一个字一个字地选。好不容易写出一部分，存档又丢了；那段故事后来发展成了《寒蝉》的前身《雏见泽停留所》。","title":"龙骑士07的手柄写作"},{"id":"trivia-201","links":[{"id":"per_fwda970b89e3a33b1696005898","kind":"person","text":"KOTOKO"},{"id":"per_fwc9f0c2ee823d72ec2c223046","kind":"person","text":"桃井晴子"},{"id":"per_fwc40ba3761304f730dd7b6db6","kind":"person","text":"AKI"}],"number":201,"sources":["https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/interview/260428y"],"text":"桃井晴子写《いちごGO!GO!》时，接到的要求很直接：KOTOKO和AKI的《恋爱CHU!》眼看就要火了，做一首能和它对抗的歌吧。","title":"桃井晴子与《恋爱CHU!》"},{"id":"trivia-202","links":[{"id":"1530","kind":"work","text":"你所期望的永远"},{"id":"per_fw9697371f2d51e08d20c172be","kind":"person","text":"栗林美奈实"}],"number":202,"sources":["https://spice.eplus.jp/articles/291490"],"text":"栗林美奈实把《你所期望的永远》的发售日——8月3日，作为自己的歌手出道纪念日。当时没有先发出道单曲，她的歌是随游戏一起和玩家见面的。","title":"栗林美奈实的出道纪念日"},{"id":"trivia-203","links":[{"id":"19232","kind":"work","text":"苍之彼方的四重奏"}],"number":203,"sources":["https://gamebiz.jp/news/356783"],"text":"《苍之彼方的四重奏》动画淡化恋爱，是原作方主动要求的：篇幅有限，他们想把重心留给空中竞技，做成一部热血运动动画。","title":"《苍之彼方的四重奏》动画里的恋爱"},{"id":"trivia-204","links":[{"id":"5148","kind":"work","text":"我们没有翅膀"},{"id":"per_fwfe3b39727799da4fd06582b7","kind":"person","text":"王雀孙"}],"number":204,"sources":["https://dengekionline.com/elem/000/000/835/835834/"],"text":"王雀孙把侄子的日常用语，写进了《我们没有翅膀》男主角童年时期的台词里。为了写出孩子说话的感觉，他专门听侄子说话，把“跟你绝交”“我有防护罩”“赌上性命”认真记进笔记。","title":"王雀孙的儿童台词"}];
